{"id":"84ff5236d2f50db8","group":"89","path":"89/89-lem-gl-tableau-open-countermodel.md","title":"Countermodel Extracted from an Open GL Tableau","display":"lem-gl-tableau-open-countermodel — Countermodel Extracted from an Open GL Tableau","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-lem-gl-tableau-open-countermodel","aliases":["89-lem-gl-tableau-open-countermodel"],"display":"lem-gl-tableau-open-countermodel — Countermodel Extracted from an Open GL Tableau","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-tableau-procedure]]","[[89-lem-gl-tableau-termination]]","[[89-df-gl-tree-frame]]","[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]","[[89-df-modal-iteration]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-lem-gl-tableau-open-countermodel"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-lem-gl-tableau-open-countermodel</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-gl-tableau-open-countermodel — Countermodel Extracted from an Open GL Tableau"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"59e94f1adddc4fdd\" href=\"?note=59e94f1adddc4fdd\" title=\"89-df-gl-tableau-procedure\">89-df-gl-tableau-procedure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fb687bda8415ad17\" href=\"?note=fb687bda8415ad17\" title=\"89-lem-gl-tableau-termination\">89-lem-gl-tableau-termination</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"cd488da32dcaca7b\" href=\"?note=cd488da32dcaca7b\" title=\"89-df-gl-tree-frame\">89-df-gl-tree-frame</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9f00301866fbd6f0\" href=\"?note=9f00301866fbd6f0\" title=\"89-df-satisfaction-modal\">89-df-satisfaction-modal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e3dbb6a9ccbd6f00\" href=\"?note=e3dbb6a9ccbd6f00\" title=\"89-df-modal-iteration\">89-df-modal-iteration</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_A^0\\Rightarrow^*T\">\\(T_A^0\\Rightarrow^*T\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SatTab}(T)\">\\(\\mathsf{SatTab}(T)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Open}(T)\">\\(\\mathsf{Open}(T)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Br},T|a,\\Gamma_b,\\mathcal U_b\">\\(\\mathsf{Br},T|a,\\Gamma_b,\\mathcal U_b\\)</span> 取真值树操作定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GLTree}\">\\(\\mathrm{GLTree}\\)</span> 取原有限有根树谓词。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^*,S^+\">\\(S^*,S^+\\)</span> 为已定义的有限路径闭包。</li>\n<li>所有最小值在有限自然数位置集合中取；开放分支的每个直接窗口均为开放真值树，因此下列最小值有定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Rightarrow^*\">\\(\\Rightarrow^*\\)</span> 以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Tab}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Tab}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\)</span> 为底集；下式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^*,S^+\">\\(S^*,S^+\\)</span> 以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Br}(T)\">\\(\\mathsf{Br}(T)\\)</span> 为底集取闭包，随后再限制到可达集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span>，不循环使用尚未定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}gl\\text{-}tableau\\text{-}open\\text{-}countermodel}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nr&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\min\\{j&lt;|T|\\mid\\mathsf{Open}(T_j)\\}\\rangle,\\\\\nS&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(a,a\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle u,j\\rangle)\\mid\na\\in\\mathsf{Br}(T),\\mathsf{Open}(T|a),u&lt;|\\mathcal U_{T|a}|,\\\nj=\\min\\{k&lt;|\\mathcal U_{T|a}(u)|\\mid\\mathsf{Open}(\\mathcal U_{T|a}(u)_k)\\}\\},\\\\\n\\Gamma_x&amp;\\coloneqq\\Gamma_{T|x}\\quad(x\\in\\mathsf{Br}(T)),\\\\\nW&amp;\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\mathsf{Br}(T)\\mid rS^*x\\},\\quad\nR\\coloneqq S^+\\cap(W\\times W),\\quad\nV(p)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in W\\mid p\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\Gamma_x)\\},\\\\\nM&amp;\\coloneqq(W,R,V),\\qquad\\mathrm{GLTree}((W,R)),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x\\in W\\ \\forall B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\\n[(B\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\Gamma_x)\\to M,x\\models B)\\land\n(\\neg B\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\Gamma_x)\\to M,x\\not\\models B)],\\\\\n&amp;M,r\\not\\models A,\\qquad\n\\neg\\exists\\vec w\\in W^{n(A)+2}\\ \\forall i\\le n(A)\\ w_iRw_{i+1}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}gl\\text{-}tableau\\text{-}open\\text{-}countermodel}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nr&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\min\\{j&lt;|T|\\mid\\mathsf{Open}(T_j)\\}\\rangle,\\\\\nS&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(a,a\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle u,j\\rangle)\\mid\na\\in\\mathsf{Br}(T),\\mathsf{Open}(T|a),u&lt;|\\mathcal U_{T|a}|,\\\nj=\\min\\{k&lt;|\\mathcal U_{T|a}(u)|\\mid\\mathsf{Open}(\\mathcal U_{T|a}(u)_k)\\}\\},\\\\\n\\Gamma_x&amp;\\coloneqq\\Gamma_{T|x}\\quad(x\\in\\mathsf{Br}(T)),\\\\\nW&amp;\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\mathsf{Br}(T)\\mid rS^*x\\},\\quad\nR\\coloneqq S^+\\cap(W\\times W),\\quad\nV(p)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in W\\mid p\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\Gamma_x)\\},\\\\\nM&amp;\\coloneqq(W,R,V),\\qquad\\mathrm{GLTree}((W,R)),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x\\in W\\ \\forall B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\\n[(B\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\Gamma_x)\\to M,x\\models B)\\land\n(\\neg B\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\Gamma_x)\\to M,x\\not\\models B)],\\\\\n&amp;M,r\\not\\models A,\\qquad\n\\neg\\exists\\vec w\\in W^{n(A)+2}\\ \\forall i\\le n(A)\\ w_iRw_{i+1}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 10 章 pp.144–146。印刷页 p 对应 PDF 第 p+39 页。</p>\n<p>开放分支的每个窗口内都有开放分支，故上述最左选择存在，不需要无限选择原则。地址严格向子窗口下降；窗口数有限，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span> 有限，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 传递非自反，且每个节点祖先线性排列。</p>\n<p>真值引理对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 的构造同时证明正、负两种断言。饱和保证正合取含两项、负合取的选定分支含至少一项否定、双重否定已展开。正字母按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 成立，负字母依开放性排除冲突；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span> 不在开放分支。</p>\n<p>负盒 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\Box C\">\\(\\neg\\Box C\\)</span> 对应已创建的窗口，所选后继含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg C\">\\(\\neg C\\)</span>，归纳假设反驳 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span>。正盒 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box C\">\\(\\Box C\\)</span> 在每次 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 下降时连同内容 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 一起复制。此处实际使用规则中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PReady}\">\\(\\mathsf{PReady}\\)</span>：建窗口前父分支已完成所有命题展开，建窗口后父分支不再添公式；所以复制清单包含父分支的最终全部正盒。后代分叉保留这些公式，每个严格可及后继遂满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span>。根含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\">\\(\\neg A\\)</span>；开放链长度界沿终止引理给出。</p>\n<p>赋值对全部命题字母定义；未出现的字母取空真值集。反模型构造没有引用第 5 章有限反模型引理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-tableau-procedure","status":"resolved","id":"59e94f1adddc4fdd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-tableau-procedure]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-gl-tableau-termination","status":"resolved","id":"fb687bda8415ad17","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-gl-tableau-termination]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-tree-frame","status":"resolved","id":"cd488da32dcaca7b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-tree-frame]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-satisfaction-modal","status":"resolved","id":"9f00301866fbd6f0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-iteration","status":"resolved","id":"e3dbb6a9ccbd6f00","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-iteration]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"T_A^0\\Rightarrow^*T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{SatTab}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Open}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Br},T|a,\\Gamma_b,\\mathcal U_b","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GLTree}","display":false},{"tex":"S^*,S^+","display":false},{"tex":"\\Rightarrow^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Tab}_{\\mathrm{GL}}","display":false},{"tex":"S^*,S^+","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Br}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"W","display":false},{"tex":"W","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}gl\\text{-}tableau\\text{-}open\\text{-}countermodel}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nr&\\coloneqq\\langle\\min\\{j<|T|\\mid\\mathsf{Open}(T_j)\\}\\rangle,\\\\\nS&\\coloneqq\\{(a,a\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle u,j\\rangle)\\mid\na\\in\\mathsf{Br}(T),\\mathsf{Open}(T|a),u<|\\mathcal U_{T|a}|,\\\nj=\\min\\{k<|\\mathcal U_{T|a}(u)|\\mid\\mathsf{Open}(\\mathcal U_{T|a}(u)_k)\\}\\},\\\\\n\\Gamma_x&\\coloneqq\\Gamma_{T|x}\\quad(x\\in\\mathsf{Br}(T)),\\\\\nW&\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\mathsf{Br}(T)\\mid rS^*x\\},\\quad\nR\\coloneqq S^+\\cap(W\\times W),\\quad\nV(p)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in W\\mid p\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\Gamma_x)\\},\\\\\nM&\\coloneqq(W,R,V),\\qquad\\mathrm{GLTree}((W,R)),\\\\\n&\\forall x\\in W\\ \\forall B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\\n[(B\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\Gamma_x)\\to M,x\\models B)\\land\n(\\neg B\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\Gamma_x)\\to M,x\\not\\models B)],\\\\\n&M,r\\not\\models A,\\qquad\n\\neg\\exists\\vec w\\in W^{n(A)+2}\\ \\forall i\\le n(A)\\ w_iRw_{i+1}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"W","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\Box C","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg C","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box C","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{PReady}","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg A","display":false}],"bytes":3357,"backlinks":[{"id":"c6c452d9588f09ff","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ee8821b1cefc81b2","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"来源：Boolos, *The Logic of Provability*，第 5 章，印刷页 83–84；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n有限反模型先取反例根生成的子模型，再展开为从根出发的有限严格路径。投影到路径最后世界，对赋值取逆像；forth/back 的盒归纳保持各公式真值。树展开的世界数可能增加，不把原来的 $2^{|\\mathrm{Sub}(A)|}$ 界强加于树模型。第 10 章的独立真值树证明现已展开于 [[89-thm-gl-tableau-decision]]；[[89-lem-gl-tableau-open-countermodel]] 同时给出上述盒子公式数约束的关系高度界。两条证明分别使用路径展开与窗口提取，不把真值树记录当作 Kripke 框架。"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-165","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-tableau]] → [[89-df-gl-tableau-characteristic]] → [[89-lem-gl-tableau-window]] → [[89-df-gl-tableau-procedure]] → [[89-lem-gl-tableau-termination]] → [[89-lem-gl-tableau-closed-soundness]] → [[89-lem-gl-tableau-open-countermodel]] → [[89-thm-gl-tableau-decision]]"}],"outgoing":["59e94f1adddc4fdd","fb687bda8415ad17","cd488da32dcaca7b","9f00301866fbd6f0","e3dbb6a9ccbd6f00"]}